<title>USA: Dow gains more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow gains more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 50 points in afternoon trading Friday as the market resumed its record-setting rally after profit-taking earlier this week.</p>
<p>At 2:40 p.m. EDT, the index of 30 blue-chip issues was up 52.93 points at 7,829.99, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
